ahead of the start of apex legends  legacy respawn released a new trailer  that gave us the backstory of kyrie  imahara an upcoming playable character  who will be added in the new season  and sticking to the themes of legacy  there are a few references in the  trailer to the rest of the titanfall  universe let's dive into it  let's start at the very beginning with  the opening shot of the trailer as kyrie  looks down at some discarded scrap where  a destroyed moon can be seen in the  background  this is where she finds the remains of  her father viper as well as the  remaining pieces of his titan  the planet is typhon we can tell because  typhon is where viper died in titanfall  2  and typhon has a destroyed moon orthros  orthros is important because it is where  the imc  first tested their fold weapon a planet  killer typhon is where the weapon is  located at the end of titanfall 2.  protagonist jack cooper would sabotage  the fold weapon  so when the imc fired it again it  backfired destroying itself  and typhon throughout the trailer we got  several close-up shots of viper's helmet  we did get to see the helmet in  titanfall 2 but not nearly as close as  this  viper don's a helmet that looks very  similar to the titanfall 2 pilots that  wield a pulse blade  though it's not exactly the same seeing  cuban blisk is a bit of an obvious  reference but one worth calling out  blisk once led an elite group of titan  pilots called the apex predators this  mercenary group always worked for the  highest bidder and you could only be  invited  into the group via special invitation  you can see vipers invite later in this  trailer during the first flashback  and speaking of blisk did you know that  he's voiced by jb blanc who also voices  caustic and apex legends  that's the problem with most pilots i  makes you blind i don't relish the title  i relish the kill when we flash back to  kyrie as a child we first see them in a  room with several paintings on the wall  one of which is of a valkyrie we learn  later in this trailer that valkyrie is  kyrie's call sign  and speaking of that call sign it marks  the seventh character in apex legends  who takes inspiration from their own  name  for their nickname valkyrie is just val  plus kyrie  the others are bluffhunder aka  bloodhound makoa gibraltar  aka gibraltar pathfinder aka pathfinder  octavio silva aka octane loba andrade  aka loba and ramya perek aka rampart  when we flash back to the present kyrie  mentions that she's a pilot which bliss  scoffs at  best pilot money can buy violet  if you haven't played titanfall or  titanfall 2 then you may not understand  that the word pilot is not used in the  same way in this universe as  ours in this universe a pilot  specifically describes someone who has  been specially trained to not only use  titans but to also use advanced weapons  and technology in ways that  normal people can't as titanfall 2  protagonist jack cooper says  a pilot sees the world differently  currently only one other pilot has  joined the apex games and that's renee  blasey aka wraith who managed to become  a 10th generation pilot  meaning she's one of the best of the  best maybe that explains why a character  has such a high win rate  of course you can't be a pilot without a  titan in the second flashback we see  kyrie piloting her father's titan  especially modded north star  all north stars are designed for  long-range aerial combat but vipers has  been specially modified to fly faster  and longer  turning it into an actual aircraft you  may notice that the north star talks  back to kyrie  every different type of titan speaks  with a different voice  but you could customize your titan's os  voice in the original game with the  diversity of genders and nationalities  respawn changed that in titanfall 2 so  that each titan had an assigned voice  the scorch legion ronan and monarch  titans all have an os voiced by men  while the ion tone and north star are  voiced by women  north stars are voiced by nora j noon an  irish actor  as kyrie is flying her father's north  star we get a more clear view of the  planet though there's no way to confirm  it looks  surprisingly like typhon this could  explain why viper fights us with such  desperation in the final moments of his  boss battle in titanfall 2. he's  defending his home and family from us  we next see viper leaving for what's  presumably the battle of typhon which is  the opening chapter of titanfall 2's  second campaign  mission in the window behind viper you  can see viper's north star standing  alongside sloan's ion  and richter's tone you kill sloane  richter and viper and titanfall 2.  and speaking of viper's death strangely  enough kyrie blames blisk for her father  dying  you'd think she would blame jack cooper  considering he is the one who pulled the  trigger and ended viper  but perhaps this is a hint that there is  more to this story blisk's decision to  not say whether viper died or was  murdered certainly seems to say so  and let's end with what's likely the  most obvious reference the person  helping kyrie transform her father's  north star into a personal jet pack is  none other than rampart in a loading  screen you could unlock during apex  legend season 6  you can see the north star in rampart's  garage teasing the upcoming story  development  and that's all the references that we  found in the new trailer did we miss  anything  let us know in the comments be sure to  like the video and subscribe to the  channel for more apex legends content  like this  if you're itching for more information  on the new season we already have a  video up that details  all the new stuff that we know is coming  apex legends legacy which is scheduled  to begin  may 4th  you
 

